## Development setup

Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), then clone and check the project:

```shell
git clone https://github.com/{{ repository_namespace }}/{{ repository_name }}.git
cd {{ repository_name }}
uv sync --locked --all-extras --dev
uv run pytest
uv run pre-commit run --all-files
```
{% if tool_ui_kind == "standalone" %}

For local service testing, export loopback URLs and distinct secrets, then run
`uv run flask --app '{{ distribution_name | replace('-', '_') }}.service:create_app()' run --port 8000`.
The provider adapter still runs in the separately started Datalab API.
{% endif %}

{% if tool_ui_kind == "in-app" %}
After changing the frontend, rebuild the bundle:

```shell
cd frontend
corepack yarn install --frozen-lockfile
corepack yarn build
cd ..
```

Commit `frontend/yarn.lock` and
`src/{{ distribution_name | replace('-', '_') }}/static/frontend/tool.js`.
{% endif %}

For integration testing, replace the Git source above with an editable path to
this checkout. Rerun `uv run invoke dev.install`, restart datalab, and exercise
the tool as a normal user.
